    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH2b1575-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">Considering that the merit is great and the harm is little,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">therefore take what is sufficient and do not change it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">Perhaps the ornate thoughts are beautifully combined,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">clear and beautiful for a thousand years.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">Shining like embroidered silk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">mournful like complex strings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">They must be so similar to what they imitate</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">that they secretly match the previous works.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">Even though the idea originates from my heart,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">I am apprehensive that others may precede me.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">If it harms integrity and goes against righteousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">even though I love it, I must discard it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">Sometimes the reeds send forth shoots and the points stand upright,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">deviating from the crowd and possessing an exceptional quality.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">Its form cannot be pursued,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">its echo is difficult to tie down.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">It stands alone as a solitary block,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">woven from uncommon sounds.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">The heart feels desolate and unmatched,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">the mind hesitates and cannot be arranged.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">Stone containing jade makes the mountain gleam,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">water holding pearls makes the river charming.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">Those hazel and prickly trees that are not trimmed</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">also receive glory in the gathered green.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">To append "Xiàlǐ" to "Bái Xuě,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">I also aid what is considered great.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-12a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-12a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">Sometimes, he entrusts his words to short rhymes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-12a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">facing the end of traces and solitary inspiration.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-12a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">He looks down upon loneliness without friends,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">he looks up at the vastness without support.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:51:25.172+09:00">Like a single string stretched alone,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-7a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">Although the passage of time and what ceases are impermanent,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-7a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">it is indeed difficult to make progress on a rough and uneven path.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-7a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">If one can adapt to changes and understand the proper order,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-7a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">it is like opening a channel to receive a spring.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-7a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">If one misses the opportunity and meets [it] only later,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-7a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">one is always grasping at the end to continue from the summit.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-7a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">If one confuses the order of black and yellow (heaven and earth, the proper order),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-7a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">then it will be murky and unclear.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">Perhaps [a phrase] pushes upward and encroaches on the preceding clause,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">or perhaps it reaches down and infringes on the following chapter;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">perhaps the words are harmful, but the reasoning is similar,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">or perhaps the words are smooth, but the meaning is obstructive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">If separated, they are both beautiful;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">if combined, they both suffer.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">Examine the best and worst with the smallest weight,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">determine what to keep and what to discard with the finest hair.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">If it is what the scales determine,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-8a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">then it should certainly conform to the standard.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">Perhaps the writing is complex and the reasoning rich,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">but the meaning does not point to the right direction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">It reaches the point where there is no double meaning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">and nothing more can be added.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">Establishing a single phrase to occupy the essence,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">is the key point of the entire piece.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">Although the many words are organized,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_001-9a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:52:02.635+09:00">they must rely on this to achieve results.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-99a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">Dignified bearing and detailed posture,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-99a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">every movement forming a spectacle,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-99a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">this comes from the beauty of one's physique.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-99a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">Thinking, knowledge, □ love's forward progress,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-99a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">power always present,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-99a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">it is fitting to □ praise them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-99a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">During the time of Xia □ Rong and bandit turmoil,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-99a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">news and inquiries were not fully known.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-100a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-100a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">○ A reproduction of the "Píngfù Tiě" of Lù Jī by the Cultural Relics Publishing House in September 1961.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-100a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">Untitled</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-100a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">"Untitled"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-100a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">Emperor Wén's power was greater than that of the Three Kingdoms,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-100a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">but he himself ended up facing north,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-100a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">though it is said he had no time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-100a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">the kingdom's foundation was already secure.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">○ From "Chū Xué Jì", Volume 9.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">Discussion on Limiting Judgments in the History of Jin</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">"Discussion on Limiting Judgments in the History of Jin"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">The three ancestors were actually always ministers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">therefore, the record of their affairs as ministers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">cannot but be treated as biographies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">this is what is meant by recording the truth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">But their names are the same as emperors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">therefore, from the registers of emperors,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">it is impossible not to call them "Annals",</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-101a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">this is the meaning of posthumously bestowing kingship.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-102a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#CH2b1575_CHANT_011-102a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-07T13:54:14.047+09:00">○ From "Chū Xué Jì", Volume 21.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
